Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.45,0:02:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第14集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.12,0:00:04.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸要我们继承他的事业{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.17,0:00:06.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔 家族事业{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Saving people, hunting things. Family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.09,0:00:10.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸最后一次猎鬼时有个搭档{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad had a partner on his last hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:11.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个家伙搞砸了 害我爸被杀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guy screwed up, got my dad killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.92,0:00:14.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那跟我们有什么… - 那家伙就是你爸爸 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What does this have to do? - It was your father, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.30,0:00:17.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许这就是魔鬼想要的 逼迫我们 想方设法让我们崩溃{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that's what the demon's doing. Pushing us. Finding ways to break us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.60,0:00:19.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我叫梅格 她被附身了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Meg. She's possessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.31,0:00:21.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,魔鬼附在人类身上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a human possessed by a demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.64,0:00:24.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"索罗门之匙" 能困住魔鬼 封住他们的力量{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key of Solomon. You get a demon in one, they're trapped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.60,0:00:29.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸死前告诉了我一些事 关于你的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before Dad died, he told me something, something about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.98,0:00:32.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他说我得救你 如果不能 就得杀了你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said that I had to save you. That if I couldn't, I'd have to kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.11,0:00:34.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他知道魔鬼对我的安排是什么吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he know the demon's plans?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.49,0:00:36.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我会变成邪恶的一方还是怎么？- 我没那么说过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Am I supposed to go dark side? - I never said that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.07,0:00:40.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你要是不小心点 总有一天得杀了我 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez, you're not careful, you will have to waste me one day, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.62,0:00:47.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,埃伦 还是我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellen. It's me again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.75,0:00:49.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有他的消息吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any chance you've heard from him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:53.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,简直像那时候到处找我爸一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear, it's like looking for my dad all over again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.84,0:00:55.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我都快急疯了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm losing my mind here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我给他打过很多次电话 每次都是留言{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I've called him a thousand times. Nothing but voice mail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.97,0:00:59.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道他去哪儿了 也不知道为什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know where he went or why.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:01.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆就那么消失了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam's just gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.89,0:01:03.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等会儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.85,0:01:08.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 你跑哪儿去了 你没事吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy? Where the hell are you? Are you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.98,0:01:11.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿 冷静点 你在哪儿？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey, hey, calm down. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.65,0:01:13.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 别动 我马上就到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, don't move. I'm on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.59,0:01:39.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 是我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, it's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.01,0:01:42.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:48.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.52,0:01:53.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.53,0:01:56.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:01:59.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你受伤了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you bleeding?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:01.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我洗不掉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I tried to wash it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 天{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:09.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是我的血{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think it's my blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.08,0:02:11.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那是谁的？- 不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whose is it? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.04,0:02:13.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 到底怎么回事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, what the hell happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.38,0:02:15.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.55,0:02:19.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我什么都想不起来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.24,0:02:38.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有什么发现吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you find out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.90,0:02:42.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你两天前以理查德·山伯拉的名字入住{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You checked in two days ago, under the name Richard Sambora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:45.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,最恐怖的你居然是Bon Jovi乐队吉他手理查德·山伯拉的迷{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the scariest part about this is that you're a Bon Jovi fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.62,0:02:46.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:49.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你的房间一直很平静 没人注意到什么异常情况{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your room's been quiet. Nobody noticed anything unusual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.75,0:02:52.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是说没人看见我满身是血地走来走去？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean no one saw me walking around covered in blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.38,0:02:55.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 对 就是这个意思 - 那我是怎么跑到这儿来的 迪恩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, that's what I mean. - Then how did I get here, Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.09,0:02:58.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我怎么了？- 不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What happened to me? - I don't know, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.38,0:03:00.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你没事就好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're okay, that's what matters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.51,0:03:02.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 其他的我们都能应付 - 是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Everything else we can deal with. - Oh, really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.93,0:03:05.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 要是我伤了谁怎么办？或者更糟 - 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What if I hurt someone? Or worse. - Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.27,0:03:10.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许这就是爸爸警告你的原因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if this is what Dad warned you about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:12.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 别妄下结论{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, whoa, whoa. Let's not jump the gun here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.98,0:03:14.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们不知道出了什么事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't know what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:16.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,得像其他"工作"一样处理{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just gotta treat this like any job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.23,0:03:18.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你记得的最后一件事是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the last thing you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.19,0:03:22.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我和你 在西德克萨斯的一个旅馆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me and you in that motel room in West Texas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.11,0:03:26.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们出门买汉堡 - 西德克萨斯？那是一周以前的事了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I went out to grab some burgers and... - West Texas? That was over a week ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:31.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:35.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后就发现 自己坐在这儿…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Next thing I knew, I was sitting here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:36.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一身是血{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:41.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好像睡了一整个月一样 - 好了 让我们回溯一下你的行动{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It felt like I'd been asleep for a month. - Okay. Retrace your steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.47,0:03:43.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,旅馆老板说你昨天下午出门以后{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The manager said you left yesterday afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.43,0:03:45.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就没见你回来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never saw you come back so...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.93,0:03:51.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.69,0:04:03.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,想起什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recognize anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:06.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:12.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:14.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我想我来过这儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I think I was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你想起来了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.59,0:04:20.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也不是 只是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really. It just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.09,0:04:22.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有种熟悉的感觉 你知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels familiar, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.51,0:04:30.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,试试那个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try that one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.27,0:04:33.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 对 - 好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:37.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.83,0:04:57.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别跟我说你居然偷了这种车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, please tell me you didn't steal this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:08.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,更多的血{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:14.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 后座{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, back seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.32,0:05:25.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你觉得我会不会用在什么人身上了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I used this on someone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:28.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我什么都不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not thinking anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 这可有点古怪了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, now this is disturbing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.00,0:05:43.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 老弟 这怎么可能是你的 说不定是其他人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, this couldn't have been you. Had to have been someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.84,0:05:46.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一个 呃 抽薄荷烟的家伙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody who, uh, smokes menthols.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.72,0:05:47.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.01,0:05:51.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,加油站的收据 就在不远的一个镇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gas receipt, few towns over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:59.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,10加仑油的收据 2号油泵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, the receipt's for 10 gallons at pump number two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.48,0:06:01.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有没有起鸡皮疙瘩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You getting any goose bumps yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:05.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,"天哪 看起来太熟悉了" 这类的感觉？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"God, this looks familiar, " déjà-vu vibes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.53,0:06:09.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许里面那人记得你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe someone inside will remember you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.95,0:06:11.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.12,0:06:22.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你 滚出去 马上 我要报警了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, out of here, now. I'm calling the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:24.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你说的是他？- 没错 就是他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You talking to him? - Yeah, I'm talking to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.71,0:06:28.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这混蛋昨天喝得烂醉 从冰箱里抓起一瓶啤酒就开始喝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jerk comes in yesterday, stinking drunk. Grabs a 40 from the fridge, starts chugging.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.63,0:06:30.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他？你居然喝麦芽酒？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy? You drinking malt liquor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.01,0:06:33.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还用瓶子敲了我的头{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not after he whipped the bottle at my frigging head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.60,0:06:36.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这家伙？- 怎么了 难道我说的是鸟语？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This guy? - What, am I speaking Urdu?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果我干了什么 真的很抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry if I did anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:40.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你最好一边走一边编你的故事 警察5分钟就到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell your story walking, pal. Okay? Po-po will be here in five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.65,0:06:42.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等会儿 他会走的 他会走的 把电话放下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, wait. He's leaving, he's leaving. Put the phone down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.11,0:06:44.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 回车里等着 - 可是 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam, go wait in the car. - But, Dean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.94,0:06:46.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,回车里等我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go wait in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.24,0:06:55.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 我只想跟你说几句话 行吗{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look, I just wanna talk to you, that's it, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.16,0:07:01.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他昨天出门后朝哪个方向走了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When he took off, which way did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.17,0:07:02.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 干吗不问他？- 因为我在问你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't you ask him? - I'm asking you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你了 算是帮我一个大忙好不好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. You'd be doing me a huge favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:08.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 帮你的忙 好啊 我就是以此为生的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, do you a favor? Well, that is what I live for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:11.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说起来 你的同伴还没付酒钱呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, your buddy didn't pay for the booze...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.47,0:07:14.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有他抽的烟 点烟的方式也是违法的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the smokes, which he also illegally lit up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.30,0:07:16.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你看见他抽烟？- 没错 简直像个烟囱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You saw him smoking? - Yeah. Guy's a chimney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.60,0:07:26.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些 嗯…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This, uh, ought to cover it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:29.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,应该够了 呃 我想起来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mm. It's, uh... It's coming back to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:31.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他拿了两包{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took two packs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:36.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当然了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.79,0:07:44.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他顺着北边的71号路 直接出城了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He went north on Route 71. Straight out of town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.43,0:07:57.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你到底怎么回事 萨姆 嗯？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on with you, Sam? Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.26,0:07:59.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,抽烟 朝别人乱挥酒瓶子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because smoking, throwing bottles at people...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.68,0:08:01.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听起来更像我干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, that sounds more like me than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:04.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 等一下 等会儿 这儿 上那条路{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, wait. Right here. Turn down that road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.73,0:08:07.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 不知道为什么 我就是知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I don't know how I know. I just do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.93,0:08:38.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不管这里住的是谁 看来不喜欢惊喜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever lives here, I'd say they don't like surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.23,0:08:52.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,该敲门吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we knock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.11,0:08:54.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想应该{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.91,0:09:01.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,奇怪的是警察居然没出现{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm surprised the cops didn't show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.96,0:09:12.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这种地方应该有警报系统{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place like this, you'd think it'd have an alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:19.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 你说的没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, you would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.17,0:09:54.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,开灯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit the lights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.31,0:10:12.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 是我干的 - 我们还不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dean, I did this. - We don't know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.11,0:10:13.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你还要什么证据？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What else do you need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:16.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你怎么解释那车子 刀 还有血？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How else do you explain the car, the knife, the blood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.19,0:10:18.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 老弟 你干吗不告诉我？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, man. Why don't you tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:23.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就算是你干的 也肯定有什么原因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if you did do this, I'm sure you had a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.04,0:10:28.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比如自卫 他是个坏家伙之类的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know: self-defense, uh, he was a bad son of a bitch, something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:36.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有身份证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't have any ID.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.88,0:10:38.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 把你的开锁器给我 - 什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I need your lock pick. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.63,0:10:40.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给我开锁器{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need your lock pick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:52.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这家伙要不是个恐怖分子 要不就是个猎手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either this guy's a Unabomber or a hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:54.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 我杀了个猎手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, I think I killed a hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.19,0:11:00.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们很快就能知道了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.66,0:11:07.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就是这儿了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.97,0:12:10.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,录像要怎么消除？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you erase this, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.02,0:12:13.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 快点 帮把手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, come on. I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:15.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我杀了他 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed him, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:19.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,破门而入 杀了他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just broke in and killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:23.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听我说 不管他是谁 他是个猎手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. Whoever this guy is, he's a hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.53,0:12:25.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就是说他的同伴会到处寻找凶手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Other hunters are gonna come looking for his killer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.99,0:12:28.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就是说 我们得销毁所有线索 明白吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which means we gotta cover our tracks, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:33.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他叫史提夫·万德尔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name was Steve Wandel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.33,0:12:36.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是他女儿的信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a letter from his daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.94,0:13:00.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,把指纹擦干净 我们走了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wipe your prints. Then we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:14.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 咱们休息几个小时 然后上路离开这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we get a couple hours of sleep, then put this place in our rear-view mirror.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.29,0:13:18.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道这很糟糕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know this is bad, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.58,0:13:20.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你得振作起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta snap out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.63,0:13:24.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 说话啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, say something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.88,0:13:27.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,睡一觉 然后早上上路？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should get some sleep and leave in the morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.84,0:13:29.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谋杀 迪恩 那是我干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murder, Dean. That's what I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.55,0:13:33.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许是 嘿 我们又不知道 也许是变形怪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe, okay? Hey, we don't know-Shapeshifter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.10,0:13:35.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 算了吧 你明知道不是 你也看了录像带{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. You know it wasn't. You saw the tape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:38.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 眼睛没有反光 也没有变形 - 可那不是你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There was no eye flare, no distortion. - But it wasn't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:42.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许那个是你 但不是真正的你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Yeah, it might've been you, but it wasn't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.19,0:13:45.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.91,0:13:52.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是你不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think maybe more than you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.79,0:13:53.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这话什么意思？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:58.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,过去几个星期里 我总是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the last few weeks, I've been having...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.17,0:14:01.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有这种感觉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been having these feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:04.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么感觉？- 愤怒…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What feelings? - Rage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:06.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,憎恨{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:09.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我没法抑制{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:12.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,变得越来越糟 一天天的变得更严重{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just gets worse. Day by day, it gets worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你没告诉过我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You never told me this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:19.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不想吓着你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't wanna scare you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,保密工作做的真不错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, bang-up job on that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.28,0:14:29.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 黄眼睛的魔鬼 你知道他对我有所安排{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, the Yellow-Eyed Demon, you know he has plans for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.91,0:14:32.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们也都知道 他曾经把其他的孩子变成凶手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know he's turned other children into killers before too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.95,0:14:35.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 除了你自己 没人能控制你 - 那可不一定 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No one can control you but you. - Doesn't seem like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.91,0:14:38.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不管怎么努力{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It feels like no matter what I do, slowly but surely...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.21,0:14:39.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我都在确实慢慢地变成 - 什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...I'm just becoming. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.79,0:14:41.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我应该变成的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who I'm meant to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:44.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你自己也说过 迪恩 我得接受自己的命运{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said it once yourself. I gotta face up to who I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.13,0:14:48.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我不是那个意思 - 但这话没错 你知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I didn't meant this. - But it's still true. You know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:50.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸也知道 所以他才告诉你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad knew that too. That's why he told you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.05,0:14:54.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 如果事情变成这样 - 闭嘴 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ...if it ever came to this. - Shut up, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.31,0:14:57.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 你答应过他的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, you promised him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.81,0:14:59.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你也答应过我的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You promised me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.65,0:15:03.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:04.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听我说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.15,0:15:09.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们会想办法解决的 好吗？我是说 总有办法 对吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna figure this out, okay? I mean, there's gotta be a way, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:12.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, there is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.62,0:15:22.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不想再伤害别人了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna hurt anyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.34,0:15:25.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,特别是你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna hurt you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.67,0:15:29.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不会的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.05,0:15:32.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不管是什么 你都能打败它{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever this is, you can fight it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.72,0:15:35.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 我不能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:38.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不可能永远这样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:40.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拿着 这是你该做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, you gotta do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.53,0:16:00.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吗 我那么努力的保护你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've tried so hard to keep you safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.25,0:16:01.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:12.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我做不到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.88,0:16:14.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,死也不干{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.23,0:16:22.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.10,0:16:25.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你会活着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.45,0:16:41.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,活着 后悔没杀了我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll live to regret this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.19,0:17:11.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,退房时间过了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's past your checkout.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.79,0:17:24.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 退房时间过了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - It's past checkout...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:27.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这儿有一对夫妇要住你的房间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have a couple here who need your room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:31.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 他们是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, I'll bet they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:34.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 几点了？- 12点半{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What time is it? - Twelve thirty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.92,0:17:37.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,跟我一起的那个家伙 你看到他了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The guy that was with me, have you seen him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.97,0:17:40.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他天亮之前开着你的车走了 你真该和他一起走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left before dawn in your car. You should've gone with him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.60,0:17:43.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在你得多交钱了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because now I'm gonna have to charge you extra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.81,0:17:46.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哦 混蛋 - 这是规定 先生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, son of a bitch. - That's just the policy, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.81,0:17:48.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我要用你的电脑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to use your computer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:50.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我干嘛要让你用我的电脑？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I let you use my computer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:56.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗨 呃 很抱歉打扰你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, uh, so sorry to bother you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:59.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但 呃 我儿子昨天晚上偷偷溜出家门{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, uh, my son snuck out of the house last night...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:03.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃 去看贾斯汀·汀布莱克的演唱会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, uh, went to a Justin Timberlake concert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.66,0:18:06.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:09.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 对 贾斯汀是很有才能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Justin is quite the triple threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.54,0:18:13.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗯 总之 他还没回家 我有点担心了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, anyway, he's not back yet and I'm just-I'm starting to worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:16.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 是的 男孩子总有一天要长大{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right, boys will be boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:21.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可萨姆有… 糖尿病 如果不及时打胰岛素{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But see, Sammy is a, uh, a diabetic and, uh, if he doesn't get his insulin...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:24.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我 我得找到他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I just-I have to find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:27.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. I'm begging you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.52,0:18:29.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不不不 我正在网上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, no, no, no. I'm on the website right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.52,0:18:32.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只要激活他手机的GPS就行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need to activate the GPS in his cell phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:37.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对 找到了 德卢斯 明尼苏达州{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right there. Duluth, Minnesota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.86,0:18:39.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 为了演唱会跑这么远的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that is a long way to go for a concert.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.78,0:18:41.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,非常感谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:50.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,晚安 谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.42,0:18:54.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不好意思 关门了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, we're closing up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.92,0:18:58.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,上路之前再来一杯行吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about just one for the road?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:03.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真没想到会是你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're about the last person I'd expect to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:07.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.39,0:19:10.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看来我总是出人意料{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}guess I'm full of surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:14.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,能来杯啤酒吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So can I get a beer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.27,0:19:17.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当然 啤酒一瓶{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, one beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:32.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how'd you find me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:37.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃 我们的工作就是这样的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, uh, it's kind of what we do, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.59,0:19:40.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 说到"我们" 迪恩在哪儿？- 他来不了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Speaking of we, where's Dean? - He couldn't make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.84,0:19:45.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那你在这儿干什么 萨姆？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what are you doing here, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:48.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们好像也没那么熟？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, we didn't exactly part on the best of terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.60,0:19:51.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.73,0:19:54.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以我才来这儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.19,0:19:59.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,想看看我们能不能消除误会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kind of-I wanted to see if we could square things, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.69,0:20:01.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看起来挺疼的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That looks like it hurts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.86,0:20:05.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 不 只是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, just...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.99,0:20:07.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,被火炉烫了一下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had a run-in with a hot stove.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:10.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你刚才说什么消除误会？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you were saying something about squaring things?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.04,0:20:13.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.50,0:20:18.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道你对我爸的看法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I know how you feel about my dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:21.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也不能怪你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I can't say I blame you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.92,0:20:23.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他鬼迷心窍{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was obsessed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,满脑子只想着猎魔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consumed with hunting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:29.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,根本不管有谁陷入危险{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he didn't care who got caught in the crossfire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:33.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想也包括你爸爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I guess that included your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:35.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但那是我爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that was my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.73,0:20:37.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.23,0:20:40.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那迪恩呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.07,0:20:45.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这个嘛 迪恩比我更像我爸 但他…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, Dean's more like my father than I am, but he-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.62,0:20:53.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好家伙…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.71,0:20:57.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你真的迷上他了 是不是？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're really carrying a torch for him, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.67,0:21:00.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是默认了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take that as a yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.47,0:21:06.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,太糟了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.18,0:21:08.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为 你看 迪恩他是喜欢你 但…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because see Dean, he likes you, sure...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.47,0:21:10.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是你想要的那种喜欢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not in the way you'd want. I mean{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.01,0:21:16.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 也许像对小妹妹一样 但是爱情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe as kind of a little sister, you know, but romance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:18.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别做梦了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just out of the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.65,0:21:22.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他把你当成黄毛丫头 知道吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He kind of thinks you're a schoolgirl, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:28.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不是想让你伤心 乔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not trying to hurt you, Jo, I'd{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.32,0:21:32.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我这么说是因为我关心你 - 你真好心 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm telling you because I care. - That's real kind of you, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:35.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.29,0:21:40.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我很在意你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I care about you a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:42.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.63,0:21:48.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们可以更进一步 乔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could be more to you, Jo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.14,0:21:50.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许你该走了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.02,0:21:55.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.90,0:22:08.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 放开我 萨姆 放手 放手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, get off me. Sam, get off me. Let go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.08,0:22:15.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,乔 乔 乔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jo, Jo, Jo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.67,0:22:24.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 求你了 别这样 求你了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, no. Please. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.27,0:22:41.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,本来不用这样的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't have to be this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:45.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许没别的办法{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe it did. Heh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:07.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事？你干嘛？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's going on? What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.63,0:23:13.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,关于你爸的死 你妈妈是怎么跟你说的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what exactly did your mom tell you about how your dad died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:14.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不是萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.06,0:23:17.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别那么肯定 回答我的问题…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be so sure about that. Answer the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.98,0:23:25.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.23,0:23:28.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是我啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.82,0:23:31.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你可以告诉我任何事 你知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can tell me anything, you know that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.95,0:23:34.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,回答问题{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Answer the question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.54,0:23:38.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fine. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.33,0:23:41.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们的爸爸在加利福尼亚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our dads were in California.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.33,0:23:43.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,魔鬼门水库{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Devil's Gate Reservoir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.92,0:23:46.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,设了个陷阱给什么再生侠之类的妖怪？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were setting a trap for some kind of hellspawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:50.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,约翰埋伏起来 我爸爸当诱饵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John was hiding, waiting. And my dad was bait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.01,0:23:53.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真是约翰的一贯风格{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just like John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.84,0:23:57.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 我打赌他把比尔当成鱼饵了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I bet he dangled Bill like meat on a hook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:23:58.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,然后呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.64,0:24:01.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那个怪物出现了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the thing showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.14,0:24:03.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,约翰太急躁了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John got too eager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.44,0:24:07.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他过早出击 害我爸爸孤立无援{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumped out too soon. Got my dad exposed out in the open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.65,0:24:10.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那东西转身…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing turned around...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.03,0:24:12.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,杀了他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.66,0:24:18.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不够准确{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not quite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.70,0:24:21.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.87,0:24:23.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？哦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.54,0:24:25.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,它只是弄伤了他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, it hurt him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:26.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有杀死他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It didn't kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.71,0:24:31.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你真的不知道真相 对吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really don't know the truth, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.38,0:24:36.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我打赌你妈妈也不知道 - 知道什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I bet your mom doesn't either. - Know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.22,0:24:38.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,比尔他…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, Bill...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.10,0:24:41.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,被开膛破肚{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was all clawed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.77,0:24:44.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,内脏都流出来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was holding his insides in his hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.10,0:24:47.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一边吐血. -. -{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was gurgling...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.69,0:24:50.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一边祈求着再见你和埃伦一面{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and praying to see you and Ellen one more time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.40,0:24:53.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,于是我爸爸…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So my dad...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.07,0:24:56.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就杀了他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}killed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:00.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像了结国病狗一样结束了他的痛苦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him out of his misery like a sick dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.33,0:25:02.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你骗人 - 我没有 是真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're lying. - I'm not. It's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.91,0:25:05.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我老爸一枪爆了你老爸的头{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daddy shot your daddy in the head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.37,0:25:09.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道这些事？- 我听说的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How could you know that? - I hear things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.88,0:25:13.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你为什么这么对我？- 有其父必有其女{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you doing this to me? - Like daddy, like daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.34,0:25:15.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是个诱饵 张嘴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're bait. Open up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.34,0:25:17.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,乖孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.10,0:25:20.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.60,0:25:23.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我求你制止我的 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I begged you to stop me, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.60,0:25:26.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 妈的 快放下刀 - 告诉过你我做不到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put the knife down, damn it. - I told you, I can't fight it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.39,0:25:28.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我头疼得像要烧起来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My head feels like it's on fire, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.86,0:25:32.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 杀了我 要不我就杀了她{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean. Kill me or I'm gonna kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.90,0:25:36.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你了 帮帮我吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. You'd be doing me a favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.61,0:25:38.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,开枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.83,0:25:42.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,开枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.13,0:25:54.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 萨姆 别这样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Sammy. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.63,0:25:59.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你有什么毛病 迪恩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell's wrong with you, Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.26,0:26:04.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就那么害怕孤独 宁可让乔去死？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you that scared of being alone that you'd rather let Jo die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.39,0:26:09.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是圣水 混蛋魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's holy water, you demonic son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.03,0:26:23.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他被附身了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was possessed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:29.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.10,0:26:50.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那么你是谁？- 我有很多名字{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So who are you? I got lots of names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.11,0:27:00.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是在萨姆失踪的时候附身的 是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been in Sam since he disappeared, haven't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.53,0:27:03.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看看你以为萨姆杀人时的表情{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've seen your face when you thought he murdered that guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.12,0:27:05.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,小可怜{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pathetic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.46,0:27:14.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你为什么不杀我？机会多的是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you kill me? You had a dozen chances.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.63,0:27:22.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 那样解决你太容易了 有什么乐趣何言啊？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that would've been too easy. Where's the fun in that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.64,0:27:25.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道吧 这是个测试{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, this was a test.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.51,0:27:29.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看你能忍受萨姆坏到什么程度才会下手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanted to see if I could push you far enough to waste Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.73,0:27:33.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,早该料到你没这个胆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should've known you wouldn't have the sack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.73,0:27:36.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,总之 游戏结束了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway, fun's over now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.27,0:27:38.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 但愿你想好如何脱身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, well, I hope you got your kicks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.03,0:27:42.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 否则你得偿还所作的一切 - 怎么还？你根本伤不了我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're gonna pay hell for this. - How? You can't hurt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.78,0:27:45.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不愿伤害你心爱的老弟的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without hurting your little brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:50.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我觉得死的会是你 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I think you're gonna die, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.29,0:27:53.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你和其他的猎手我都能找到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and every other hunter I can find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.67,0:27:59.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只要看见萨姆清澈无辜的眼神{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One look at Sam's dewy, sensitive eyes...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.96,0:28:01.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是人都会让他进屋的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll let me right in their door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.38,0:29:20.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是迪恩 请留下口讯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Dean, leave a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.95,0:29:49.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.87,0:29:52.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.54,0:29:56.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,放松点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.21,0:30:00.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 萨姆在哪？- 我不知道 我一直在找你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's Sam? - I don't know. I've been looking for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.04,0:30:02.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,来吧 起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.09,0:30:11.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unh! Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.85,0:30:15.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别像小孩那样怕疼 天哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a baby. Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.43,0:30:18.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 就快{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, almost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.19,0:30:19.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 拿出来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, got it. Got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.28,0:30:30.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 天哪 你简直是个屠夫 - 多谢夸奖{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- God, you're a butcher. - You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.45,0:30:31.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了没有？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, are we done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.74,0:30:34.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就不能闭嘴好让我包扎伤口？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you give me two minutes to patch you up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.33,0:30:36.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,流血过多死了还怎么救萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't help Sam if you're bleeding to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.62,0:30:40.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他被附身？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how did you know that he was possessed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.75,0:30:46.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 只是感觉那肯定不是他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah! Uh, I didn't. I just knew that it couldn't have been him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.13,0:30:50.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 迪恩 - 什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, Dean. - Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.93,0:30:55.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道恶魔一向说谎话 但有没有偶尔说真话的时候？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know demons lie, but do they ever tell the truth too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.64,0:31:00.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有时 我猜是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sometimes, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.40,0:31:03.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,特别知道真话会刺激得你发狂的时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially if they know it'll mess with your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.61,0:31:08.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么这么问？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.45,0:31:10.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.20,0:31:12.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不要紧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It doesn't matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.99,0:31:15.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 你觉得他之后会去哪？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do you have any idea where he's headed to next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.29,0:31:17.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就目前而言 他会去找离这最近的猎手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, so far, he's been going after the nearest hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.12,0:31:20.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道最近的一个在南达科他州{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the closest one I know is in South Dakota.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.50,0:31:22.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,包好了 我们走{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, good. I'm done. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.13,0:31:25.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不能去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.05,0:31:28.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么不能？我已经被卷进来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hell I'm not. I'm a part of this now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.84,0:31:30.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一言难尽{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't say it more plain than this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.88,0:31:33.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你要是跟来我还要时刻担心你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You try and follow me and I'll tie you back to that post and leave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.85,0:31:36.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是我的事 不能让你因此受到伤害{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my fight. I'm not getting your blood on my hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.14,0:31:38.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就是原因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's just how it's gonna be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.15,0:31:44.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:46.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,接着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.69,0:31:51.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,吃点这个 用来止疼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take these. They'll help with the pain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.32,0:31:55.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,多谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.70,0:32:00.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,晚点打电话给你 好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call you later, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.54,0:32:08.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 你不会了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.73,0:32:31.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.54,0:32:45.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 萨姆 - 嘿 鲍比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam. - Hey, Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.71,0:32:46.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好久不见{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.50,0:32:50.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,进来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.93,0:32:59.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么风把你吹到这来了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what brings you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.22,0:33:02.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,附近有个活儿 所以来和你打声招呼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working a job nearby and I thought I'd stop in to say hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.23,0:33:03.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩在哪？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.10,0:33:07.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在某处和女孩缠绵呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holed up somewhere with a girl and a 12 pack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.02,0:33:09.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 真的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.57,0:33:11.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,她很辣？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she pretty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.44,0:33:14.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谁说不是 估计还没尽兴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ask me, he's in way over his head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.82,0:33:18.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's good to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.45,0:33:21.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,敬约翰{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To John.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.04,0:33:25.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,敬爸爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.97,0:33:40.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你做了什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What'd you do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.43,0:33:42.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在啤酒里加了点圣水{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little holy water in your beer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.81,0:33:44.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆绝不会有事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam never would've noticed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.23,0:33:47.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你不是萨姆 对吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, you're not Sam, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.98,0:33:51.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,休想引骗子上钩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't try to con a con man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.16,0:34:03.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. Unh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.55,0:34:22.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.39,0:34:24.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从死亡边缘爬回来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back from the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.64,0:34:26.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像从前那样 不是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Getting to be a regular thing for you, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.14,0:34:29.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像只蟑螂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like a cockroach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.31,0:34:31.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你这自以为是的家伙敢紧滚出来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about I smack that smart-ass out of your mouth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.65,0:34:33.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, careful now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.40,0:34:37.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 不然会伤了这副皮囊 - 哦 别担心 这样不会太伤萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wouldn't wanna bruise this fine packaging. - Don't worry. This isn't gonna hurt Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.82,0:34:39.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就另当别论了…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, on the other hand-{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.91,0:34:47.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在愿意开口了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feel like talking now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.50,0:34:49.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆仍是受我控制的肉身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam's still my meat puppet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.83,0:34:54.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我可以让他咬断自己的舌头 - 不 你呆不长了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'll make him bite off his tongue. - No. You won't be in him long enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.84,0:34:56.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,鲍比{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bobby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.93,0:35:06.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看见了 你这婊子养的 不管你有什么计划{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, whatever bitch-boy master plan you demons are cooking up...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.93,0:35:09.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都不许利用萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're not getting Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.81,0:35:11.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,明白么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.77,0:35:14.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为我解决掉你们每一个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm gonna kill every one of you first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.62,0:35:28.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你真以为这是我们的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think that's what this is about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.58,0:35:31.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,计划吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The master plan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.75,0:35:34.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我根本不在乎什么计划{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't give a rat's ass about the master plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.88,0:35:41.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,噢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.68,0:35:43.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看来不起作用{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't seem to be working.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.26,0:35:46.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我倒学了点新玩意儿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I learned a few new tricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.57,0:36:06.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这不像是附身 怎么回事 鲍比？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't going like I pictured. What's going on, Bobby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.45,0:36:11.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是个封魔咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a binding link.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.71,0:36:12.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像把锁{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a lock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.96,0:36:15.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,把他自己封在萨姆身体里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's locked himself inside Sam's body.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.54,0:36:17.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们现在怎么办？- 我也不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What the hell do we do? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.43,0:36:30.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在 好多了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There. That's better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.61,0:36:42.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当人们想描述最糟糕的事情…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know when people wanna describe the worst possible thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.45,0:36:45.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们都会用地狱来形容{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They say it's "like hell."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.49,0:36:48.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 那么说是有原因的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's a reason for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.37,0:36:51.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,地狱就像 嗯… . -{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell is like a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.62,0:36:58.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,确实是地狱 即使对魔鬼而言也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's like hell. Even for demons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.54,0:37:01.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是一个由血肉和恐惧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a prison made of bone and flesh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.80,0:37:04.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,筑成的牢笼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and blood and fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.14,0:37:10.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你把我打了回去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you sent me back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.93,0:37:13.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 梅格 - 不…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Meg? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.94,0:37:15.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不再是了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.98,0:37:17.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我现在是萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.48,0:37:21.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.15,0:37:25.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我见到了你父亲 他向你问好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw your dad there. He says, "Howdy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.86,0:37:30.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,支持我撑下去的是一旦某天我能爬出来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that I had to hold onto was that I would climb out one day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.33,0:37:33.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就要把你折磨得痛不欲生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I was gonna torture you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.41,0:37:36.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一点一点的折磨你 就像把虫子的翅膀一片一片扯下来那样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice and slow, like pulling the wings off an insect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.96,0:37:39.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是不论我怎么对你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But whatever I do to you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.50,0:37:42.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都不及你内心的悔恨 对吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's nothing compared to what you do to yourself, is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.46,0:37:46.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我能从你的眼睛里看出来 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see it in your eyes, Dean. You're worthless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.51,0:37:49.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是个废物 连自己老爸都救不了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't save your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.35,0:37:51.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且内心深处{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And deep down...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.85,0:37:54.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你也清楚挽救不了你的弟弟{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know that you can't save your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.52,0:37:57.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有你他们会过的更好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'd have been better off without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.13,0:38:28.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sammy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:34.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我错过什么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I miss anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.20,0:38:55.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 你看起来糟透了 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, you really look like crap, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.75,0:38:58.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊 拜你所赐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right back at you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.75,0:39:05.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是什么 鲍比？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it, Bobby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.05,0:39:08.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们俩知道叫史提夫·万德尔的猎手吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You boys ever hear of a hunter named Steve Wandel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.84,0:39:11.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么问这个？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you ask?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.43,0:39:15.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从朋友那听说 万德尔死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just heard from a friend. Wandel's dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.81,0:39:19.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在家里被杀了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Murdered in his own house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.94,0:39:23.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们不知道这事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't know anything about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.94,0:39:25.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有 从未听过这人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir. Never heard of the guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.86,0:39:28.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 - 那好 继续装作不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dean. - Good. Keep it that way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.07,0:39:32.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,万德尔的兄弟正在到处查找线索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wandel's buddies are looking for someone or something to string up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.82,0:39:34.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们追得很紧 (一旦抓住谁)可没机会解释{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not gonna slow down to listen to reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.79,0:39:37.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You understand what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.46,0:39:40.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们最好快上路吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We better hit the road.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.37,0:39:44.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,要是你还记得我们车停哪里了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can remember where we parked the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.71,0:39:46.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给你 拿着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Take these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.30,0:39:50.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 符咒{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are they? - Charms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.05,0:39:53.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可以阻止附身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll fend off possession.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.30,0:39:57.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,恶魔还在游荡 能防止它再次附身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That demon's still out there. This'll stop it from getting back up in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.60,0:40:01.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 有点暧昧… 但是 谢谢你 - 不客气{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That sounds vaguely dirty, but thanks. You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.06,0:40:04.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们俩最好小心点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You boys be careful now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.31,0:40:06.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.22,0:40:33.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你没事吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.85,0:40:37.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.27,0:40:40.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你没被附身吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that you in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.98,0:40:47.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我某些本性被唤醒了 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was awake for some of it, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.69,0:40:53.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我看见了自己亲手杀了万德尔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I watched myself kill Wandel with my own two hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.28,0:40:57.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看到了他眼中生命之光渐渐消逝{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw the light go out in his eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.20,0:41:01.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那一定很可怕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That must've been awful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.46,0:41:05.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不是说这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not my point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:09.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我差点也对乔下手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I almost carved up Jo too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.80,0:41:12.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但不论我做了什么你都不会开枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But no matter what I did, you wouldn't shoot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.88,0:41:15.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我没做错 萨姆 那不是你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the right move, Sam. It wasn't you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.51,0:41:16.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是 这次是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.51,0:41:19.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那下次怎么办？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about next time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.93,0:41:27.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 爸爸嘱咐我要杀你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, when Dad told me that I might have to kill you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.06,0:41:29.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是在不得已得情形下{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was only if I couldn't save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.23,0:41:34.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如今 即使最坏的情况发生了 我还是要救你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, if it's the last thing I do, I'm gonna save you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.91,0:41:45.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 没什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.62,0:41:47.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.33,0:41:52.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老弟 你居然… 让那小妞整整赖在身上一周{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you, like, full-on had a girl inside you for, like, a whole week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.97,0:41:58.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真够下流的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's pretty naughty.{\r}
